{'symbol': 'VTRS', 'date': '2022-03-30 09:00:00', 'title': 'SESAME WORKSHOP AND VIATRIS LAUNCH NEW EMOTIONAL HEALTH AND WELLBEING RESOURCES FOR FAMILIES GRAPPLING WITH EFFECTS OF COVID-19', 'text': 'NEW VIDEOS AND RESOURCES SUPPORT THE SOCIAL AND EMOTIONAL NEEDS OF FAMILIES ACROSS GENERATIONS PITTSBURGH , MARCH 30, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SESAME WORKSHOP, THE NONPROFIT BEHIND SESAME STREET, IS LAUNCHING NEW BILINGUAL RESOURCES MADE POSSIBLE BY VIATRIS INC. (NASDAQ: VTRS) TO SUPPORT THE SOCIAL AND EMOTIONAL NEEDS OF FAMILIES AND CAREGIVERS ACROSS GENERATIONS AS THEY COLLECTIVELY CONTINUE TO ADAPT TO THE IMPACTS OF THE COVID-19 PANDEMIC. BUILDING ON PREVIOUS GLOBAL RESOURCES ADDRESSING KEY EMOTIONS FELT DURING THE PANDEMIC, LAUNCHED IN 2020, THE NEW PHASE INCLUDES FIVE NEW VIDEOS FEATURING BELOVED SESAME CHARACTERS LIKE ELMO AND GROVER, AS THEY LEARN TO HANDLE BIG CHANGES, HOLD MINDFUL MOMENTS, TAKE CARE OF THEMSELVES AND THEIR LOVED ONES, AND SO MUCH MORE.'}